    "Context records the LOAD DATA LOCAL INFILE availability check and its outcome before any code change.",
    "After apply_rf1 on update set 1 at SF0.01 against a local SingleStore container, ORDERS and LINEITEM row counts and per-column checksums equal those from the VALUES path on an identical starting database (evidence in context).",
    "A timer-boundary unit test shows file reading, the LOAD DATA statement, BEGIN and COMMIT are inside the RF1 timer and nothing precedes the timer.",
